<title>USA: Caretenders Q4 March 31 net increases.</title>
<headline>Caretenders Q4 March 31 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended	   Year Ended</p>
<p>		   3/31/97	  3/31/96  3/31/97	  3/31/96</p>
<p> Net Revenues $20,238,649 $16,029,571 $76,773,039 $63,226,968</p>
<p> Net Income	 414,524     255,352   1,759,370   1,579,283</p>
<p>Weighted primary Shares</p>
<p>		    3,133,300   3,151,583   3,141,865   3,148,707</p>
<p>Net Income Per Share</p>
<p>			   0.13	  0.08	  0.56	  0.50</p>
<p>NOTE:  Caretenders HealthCorp said its net income for the fourth quarter and fiscal 1997 includes $370,000, or $0.12 per share, of operating losses related to startup operations.</p>
<p>Net income for fiscal 1997 also includes $1.2 million, or $0.39 per share, of operating losses related to startup operations.</p>
</text>
